pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  讲解建议：左边三个读数是全年水量总结——年径流量（收入）4.82 亿、入海余量（净利润）0.61 亿、水位（现金流）0.32 亿由负转正；右边瀑布图解释净利润如何从源头毛利一路汇到入海口。单位亿元，演示占位数据。
elements:
  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 400, 18]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 远川 2025 · 水文年报

  - elementId: meta-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 40, 300, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 10
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 里程 K2 / K7

  - elementId: station-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 62, 600, 46]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$primary;">K2</span>　流量实测</p>

  - elementId: conclusion
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 116, 840, 24]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 从源头（营业毛利）到入海口（净利润）的一笔水量账：流量基本达标，余量与水位明显改善。

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 152, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  # —— 左栏：三个水文读数 ——
  - elementId: m1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 166, 250, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10
      bold: true
      letterSpacing: 2
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 年径流量 · 营业收入
  - elementId: m1-value
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 186, 250, 44]
    content:
      style: "$reading"
      fontSize: 34
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>4.82<span style="font-size:14px; color:$muted;"> 亿元</span></p>
  - elementId: m1-delta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 234, 250, 18]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11.5
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 同比 +14.2%

  - elementId: m-rule-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 262, 250, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: m2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 272, 250, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10
      bold: true
      letterSpacing: 2
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 入海余量 · 净利润
  - elementId: m2-value
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 292, 250, 44]
    content:
      style: "$reading"
      fontSize: 34
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>0.61<span style="font-size:14px; color:$muted;"> 亿元</span></p>
  - elementId: m2-delta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 340, 250, 18]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11.5
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 同比 +38.6%

  - elementId: m-rule-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 368, 250, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: m3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 378, 250, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10
      bold: true
      letterSpacing: 2
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 水位 · 经营性现金流
  - elementId: m3-value
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 398, 250, 44]
    content:
      style: "$reading"
      fontSize: 34
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>0.32<span style="font-size:14px; color:$muted;"> 亿元</span></p>
  - elementId: m3-delta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 446, 250, 18]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11.5
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 由负转正 · 三年来首次

  # —— 右栏：水量账瀑布图 ——
  - elementId: chart-heading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [350, 164, 550, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 水量账：从源头毛利到入海净利（亿元）

  - elementId: profit-bridge
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [350, 196, 550, 296]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$bg" }
    data:
      cols: [项目, 金额, 是否合计]
      rows:
        - [源头·营业毛利, 2.76, true]
        - [销售及市场, -0.98, null]
        - [研发费用, -0.66, null]
        - [管理费用, -0.31, null]
        - [财务及税费, -0.20, null]
        - [入海·净利润, 0.61, true]
    xAxis:
      axisLine: false
      gridLine: false
      label: { fontSize: 10.5, color: "$muted" }
    yAxis:
      min: 0
      max: 3.2
      axisLine: false
      gridLine: { color: "$line" }
      label: { numberFormat: "0.0", fontSize: 10.5, color: "$muted" }
    legend: false
    fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
    series:
      - type: waterfall
        encode: { x: 项目, y: 金额, isTotal: 是否合计 }
        totalBars: { fill: "$primaryDeep" }
        increaseBars: { fill: "$accent" }
        decreaseBars: { fill: "$accent3" }
        dataLabels: { show: true, numberFormat: "0.00", color: "$text", fontSize: 10 }

  # —— 河流里程线 K0–K7 ——
